---
import { FileMatrix } from './react/FileMatrix';
import { Reveal } from './react/Reveal';
import { docFiles } from '../data/content';

const huntCount = docFiles.filter((f) => f.group === 'hunt').length;
---

<section id="files" class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24">
  <Reveal client:visible>
    <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter md:text-4xl">{docFiles.length} 个文件，三组职责</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
      核心流程定契约，{huntCount} 个搜寻类覆盖从内存安全到本地 IPC 的攻击面，校验工程用零依赖脚本锁住结构。先按分组浏览，再用搜索定位。
    </p>
  </Reveal>
  <div class="mt-8">
    <FileMatrix client:visible />
  </div>
</section>
